{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-21",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Vector subtraction c = a - b represented as a + (-b): preserve two separate standalone vectors and all three directed sides of the right-hand triangle, including the outlined leftward result. Equal vector copies and exact coordinates are mathematical regularization, not measured scan ratios. All small unlabelled ink endpoint markers are MODERN additions for visible inventory coverage, not source dots, source labels or numerical givens. Scoped r1 display repair: ordinary letters with deterministic over-arrows replace the observed missing combining glyph; outlined arrowhead interiors use JSXGraph paper polygons. No semantic endpoint, projection or footbracket coordinate is changed.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8p/figures/fig-21.png",
      "sha256": "a4605a9d47afdab96eee5c6a2330da42f9ea7f6b818b0bd7105e5e95ac3b7842"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy8-c1-s1-n5",
        "text": "**$2.$\n矢量减法** 为了求等于两个矢量 $\\vec a$ 和 $\\vec b$ 之差的矢量$\\vec c$，应当把矢量 $\\vec a$ 和 $(-\\vec b)$ 相加（图 $21$）："
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy8-c1-s1-n5",
        "text": "$\\vec c=\\vec a-\\vec b=\\vec a+(-\\vec b)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy8-c1-s1-n5",
        "text": "矢量$(-\\vec{b})$的大小等于矢量$\\vec{b}$的大小，其方向与矢量$\\vec{b}$的方向相反."
      }
    ],
